{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6936eebd3b4e6c1810c9b5e1e9b35e3f27b94c0bf7598e255373f6e3debc1cef", "ja": "え？　なにか問題があるのか？", "zh": "诶？有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "7f79cbfd7b2d38f2aca3e1e2cba74f1ee9846467d2369f5cac5177d37be29fc9", "ja": "問題大ありです！　いいですか？\n私にセクシーが似合うっていうことは……。", "zh": "问题可大了！你听我说啊？\n我适合走性感路线这件事……就意味着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "9b4ac09a146f9ff25d90f1f31daf4f1b2842f5039526695cd82e49bf98bc3907", "ja": "これから、セクシーな仕事が\nメッ……チャ増えてまうってことやないですか！！", "zh": "这就是说，以后性感的工作会——超！——大幅增加，不是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5c406707877a980d452e35b40bd2bb0158d8f29cb020373b14153e83c6a8550e", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうかな……？", "zh": "咦？有、有这么夸张吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "b6a42781ff6ea0be12691eb132e626344e85931fe3387df22b967d26881afb2c", "ja": "そうに決まってます！\nああ～、そんなんどないしよう～！", "zh": "肯定是这样啊！\n啊啊～那种情况该怎么办呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "c045b6ba4efffafe02629c7ba1a029ac8aeaa336d6953d07aeb2a0aef9b57763", "ja": "私がいくらセクシーでも、あんまりスゴいのは……\n風花とはスタイルが違いますし……。", "zh": "就算我再怎么性感，太过火的话……\n跟风花的风格也不一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "4ded5ab376da351d4642116bbe2f1c421b68cf9dadbfc26db279cdd217684c77", "ja": "でも仕事なら、四の五の言うてられへんし……。\nあーもう私、どないしたらええんやー！", "zh": "不过既然是工作，也就没法挑三拣四了……  \n啊——我到底该怎么办才好啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1014_p", "source_sha256": "30e34f6475839125d0ad6f47a151473581b3fbb92852f2ef1d7f9a5ff72cf04d", "ja": "いや、別にセクシーな仕事ばっかり取ってくる事は\nしないから、安心してくれていいんだけど……。", "zh": "不是，我倒也不会专门去接那种性感的通告，\n所以你大可以放心啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0144_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "4d83813131374846b582ef04a9b17483a633e3eec794cce779220eff6d1aa230", "ja": "でも{$P$}さんも今、\nセクシーが似合うって言うたやないですか！", "zh": "可是刚才{$P$}先生也说了，我很适合性感风格，不是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
